"shrink-0\"><img class=\"border-2\" src=\"/image/warning.png\" alt=\"Report Question\" style=\"width: 30px;height: 30px;padding: 4px;border-radius: 50%\"></button></div></div>   <div class=\"question xl:text-lg px-4 py-2.5\"><p>A gas mixture consists of 8 moles of argon and 6 moles of oxygen at temperature T. Neglecting all vibrational modes, the total internal energy of the system is:</p></div></div> <div class=\"options md:px-4 flex flex-col gap-2 lg:gap-4\"><div role=\"button\" class=\"flex items-center gap-2 max-md:card md:rounded px-4 py-4 dark:border-gray-500 md:border-2 cursor-pointer select-none transition-all relative bg-opacity-20   hover:border-2   \"><div class=\"shrink-0 flex items-center justify-center text-white text-sm rounded-[50%] w-[25px] h-[25px] bg-blue-600  \">A</div>  <div class=\"grow question xl:text-lg\">29 RT</div> </div><div role=\"button\" class=\"flex items-center gap-2 max-md:card md:rounded px-4 py-4 dark:border-gray-500 md:border-2 cursor-pointer select-none transition-all relative bg-opacity-20   hover:border-2   \"><div class=\"shrink-0 flex items-center justify-center text-white text-sm rounded-[50%] w-[25px] h-[25px] bg-blue-600  \">B</div>  <div class=\"grow question xl:text-lg\">27 RT</div> </div><div role=\"button\" class=\"flex items-center gap-2 max-md:card md:rounded px-4 py-4 dark:border-gray-500 md:border-2 cursor-pointer select-none transition-all relative bg-opacity-20   hover:border-2   \"><div class=\"shrink-0 flex items-center justify-center text-white text-sm rounded-[50%] w-[25px] h-[25px] bg-blue-600  \">C</div>  <div class=\"grow question xl:text-lg\">20 RT</div> </div><div role=\"button\" class=\"flex items-center gap-2 max-md:card md:rounded px-4 py-4 dark:border-gray-500 md:border-2 cursor-pointer select-none transition-all relative bg-opacity-20   hover:border-2   \"><div class=\"shrink-0 flex items-center justify-center text-white text-sm rounded-[50%] w-[25px] h-[25px] bg-blue-600  \">D</div>  <div class=\"grow question xl:text-lg\">21 RT</div> </div></div>  <div class=\"text-center\"><button class=\"shadow drop-shadow-sm bg-blue-600 text-white px-4 py-2 rounded hover:font-bold transition-all select-none\" aria-label=\"Check Answer Button\">Check Answer</button></div> </div>",
