"shrink-0\"><img class=\"border-2\" src=\"/image/warning.png\" alt=\"Report Question\" style=\"width: 30px;height: 30px;padding: 4px;border-radius: 50%\"></button></div></div>   <div class=\"question xl:text-lg px-4 py-2.5\"><p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"CHTML\" style=\"font-size: 119.5%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c30\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2E\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c30\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c38\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-texatom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mtext style=\"font-family: MJXZERO, Roboto, &quot;Tiro Bangla&quot;, &quot;Tiro Devanagari Hindi&quot;, sans-serif;\"><mjx-utext variant=\"-explicitFont\" style=\"font-size: 83.7%; padding: 0.896em 0px 0.239em; width: 5px;\">&nbsp;</mjx-utext></mjx-mtext><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c6B\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c67\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-texatom></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>0.08</mn><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mtext>&nbsp;</mtext><mi data-mjx-auto-op=\"false\">kg</mi></mrow></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> air is heated at constant volume through <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"CHTML\" style=\"font-size: 119.5%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-msup><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c35\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: 0.363em;\"><mjx-texatom size=\"s\" texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2218\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-texatom></mjx-script></mjx-msup><mjx-texatom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c43\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-texatom></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mn>5</mn><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mo>∘</mo></mrow></msup><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></mrow></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container>. The specific heat of air at constant volume is <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"CHTML\" style=\"font-size: 119.5%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c30\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2E\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c31\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c37\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-texatom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mtext style=\"font-family: MJXZERO, Roboto, &quot;Tiro Bangla&quot;, &quot;Tiro Devanagari Hindi&quot;, sans-serif;\"><mjx-utext variant=\"-explicitFont\" style=\"font-size: 83.7%; padding: 0.896em 0px 0.239em; width: 5px;\">&nbsp;</mjx-utext></mjx-mtext><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c6B\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c63\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c61\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c6C\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-texatom><mjx-texatom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2F\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-texatom><mjx-msup><mjx-texatom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c6B\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c67\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-texatom><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: 0.421em;\"><mjx-texatom size=\"s\" texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2218\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-texatom></mjx-script></mjx-msup><mjx-texatom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c43\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-texatom></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>0.17</mn><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mtext>&nbsp;</mtext><mi data-mjx-auto-op=\"false\">kcal</mi></mrow><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mo>/</mo></mrow><msup><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi data-mjx-auto-op=\"false\">kg</mi></mrow><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mo>∘</mo></mrow></msup><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></mrow></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> and <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"CHTML\" style=\"font-size: 119.5%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-texatom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c4A\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-texatom><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c3D\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c34\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2E\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c31\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c38\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">J</mi></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>4.18</mn></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> joule/<mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"CHTML\" style=\"font-size: 119.5%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-texatom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mtext style=\"font-family: MJXZERO, Roboto, &quot;Tiro Bangla&quot;, &quot;Tiro Devanagari Hindi&quot;, sans-serif;\"><mjx-utext variant=\"-explicitFont\" style=\"font-size: 83.7%; padding: 0.896em 0px 0.239em; width: 5px;\">&nbsp;</mjx-utext></mjx-mtext><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c63\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c61\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c6C\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-texatom></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mtext>&nbsp;</mtext><mi data-mjx-auto-op=\"false\">cal</mi></mrow></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container>. The change in its internal energy is approximately.</p></div></div> <div class=\"options md:px-4 flex flex-col gap-2 lg:gap-4\"><div role=\"button\" class=\"flex items-center gap-2 max-md:card md:rounded px-4 py-4 dark:border-gray-500 md:border-2 cursor-pointer select-none transition-all relative bg-opacity-20   hover:border-2   \"><div class=\"shrink-0 flex items-center justify-center text-white text-sm rounded-[50%] w-[25px] h-[25px] bg-blue-600  \">A</div>  <div class=\"grow question xl:text-lg\">318 J</div> </div><div role=\"button\" class=\"flex items-center gap-2 max-md:card md:rounded px-4 py-4 dark:border-gray-500 md:border-2 cursor-pointer select-none transition-all relative bg-opacity-20   hover:border-2   \"><div class=\"shrink-0 flex items-center justify-center text-white text-sm rounded-[50%] w-[25px] h-[25px] bg-blue-600  \">B</div>  <div class=\"grow question xl:text-lg\">298 J</div> </div><div role=\"button\" class=\"flex items-center gap-2 max-md:card md:rounded px-4 py-4 dark:border-gray-500 md:border-2 cursor-pointer select-none transition-all relative bg-opacity-20   hover:border-2   \"><div class=\"shrink-0 flex items-center justify-center text-white text-sm rounded-[50%] w-[25px] h-[25px] bg-blue-600  \">C</div>  <div class=\"grow question xl:text-lg\">284 J</div> </div><div role=\"button\" class=\"flex items-center gap-2 max-md:card md:rounded px-4 py-4 dark:border-gray-500 md:border-2 cursor-pointer select-none transition-all relative bg-opacity-20   hover:border-2   \"><div class=\"shrink-0 flex items-center justify-center text-white text-sm rounded-[50%] w-[25px] h-[25px] bg-blue-600  \">D</div>  <div class=\"grow question xl:text-lg\">142 J</div> </div></div>  <div class=\"text-center\"><button class=\"shadow drop-shadow-sm bg-blue-600 text-white px-4 py-2 rounded hover:font-bold transition-all select-none\" aria-label=\"Check Answer Button\">Check Answer</button></div> </div>",
