	        "explanation": "<div class=\"flex flex-col gap-2 max-md:card max-md:py-2\"> <div class=\"px-4\"><h2 class=\"my-2.5 text-lg text-blue-500 font-bold svelte-1pnvkqi\">Explanation</h2> <div class=\"question xl:text-lg mt-2\">\n<p>In thermodynamics, the pressure-temperature graph for an ideal gas kept at constant volume (isochoric process) is a straight line. This is because for an ideal gas, the pressure is proportional to the temperature (as described by the ideal gas law, PV = nRT, where P is the pressure, V is the volume, n is the number of moles, R is the gas constant, and T is the temperature).</p>\n<p>It is clear from graph that for all the gases lines of graphs meet at same value.</p>\n<p>At <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"CHTML\" style=\"font-size: 119.5%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-texatom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c78\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-texatom></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container>-axis (temperature axis) <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"CHTML\" style=\"font-size: 119.5%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-texatom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c50\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-texatom></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi></mrow></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> is zero but temperature is negative and it will be equal to 0 K or <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"CHTML\" style=\"font-size: 119.5%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2212\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-msup><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c32\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c37\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c33\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: 0.403em;\"><mjx-texatom size=\"s\" texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2218\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-texatom></mjx-script></mjx-msup><mjx-texatom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c43\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-texatom></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>−</mo><msup><mn>273</mn><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mo>∘</mo></mrow></msup><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></mrow></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container>.</p></div></div></div>",
