	        "explanation": "<div class=\"flex flex-col gap-2 max-md:card max-md:py-2\"> <div class=\"px-4\"><h2 class=\"my-2.5 text-lg text-blue-500 font-bold svelte-1pnvkqi\">Explanation</h2> <div class=\"question xl:text-lg mt-2\">Work done = P<mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"CHTML\" style=\"font-size: 119.5%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c394\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container>V<br><br>\n = 3 × 10<sup>5</sup> × 1600 × 10<sup>–6</sup><br><br>\n = 480 J<br><br>\n Only 10% of heat is used in work done.<br><br>\n Hence <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"CHTML\" style=\"font-size: 119.5%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c394\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container>Q = 4800 J\n The rest goes in internal energy, which is 90% of\nheat.<br><br>\n Change in internal energy = 0.9 × 4800 = 4320 J</div></div></div>",
