	        "q": "<div class=\"question-component md:card md:rounded-lg md:py-4 flex flex-col gap-2 lg:gap-4 svelte-1pnvkqi\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-2 max-md:card max-md:pt-3\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between gap-3 px-4 pb-2 border-b-gray-100 dark:border-opacity-20\" style=\"border-bottom-width: 1px; border-bottom-style: solid;\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-center text-white dark:text-blue-400 bg-blue-600 dark:bg-opacity-10 text-sm shrink-0\" style=\"width: 25px; height: 25px; border-radius: 50%;\">3</div> <div class=\"flex flex-col gap-1.5\"><div class=\"font-semibold text-sm max-md:text-xs\">JEE Main 2022 (Online) 27th July Evening Shift</div> <div class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs\"><div class=\"px-1.5 py-0.5 bg-opacity-10 rounded-sm text-blue-700 bg-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400 text-ellipsis overflow-hidden whitespace-nowrap\">MCQ (Single Correct Answer)</div> <div class=\"px-1.5 py-0.5 bg-opacity-5 rounded-sm text-green-700 bg-green-600 dark:text-green-400 \">+4</div> <div class=\"px-1.5 py-0.5 bg-opacity-5 rounded-sm text-red-700 bg-red-600 dark:text-red-400 \">-1</div> </div></div></div> <div class=\"flex justify-end gap-2\"><div class=\"shrink-0 flex items-center gap-4 select-none text-sm relative\"><img class=\"border-2\" src=\"/image/google_translate.svg\" alt=\"Change Language\" style=\"width: 30px; height: 30px; padding: 4px; border-radius: 50%;\"> <div class=\"card drop-shadow absolute top-2 right-0 transition-all rounded lang-dialog false scale-0 translate-x-3 svelte-1pnvkqi\" style=\"min-width: 150px;\"><button class=\"px-4 py-2 block w-full text-left cursor-pointer lang-item font-bold text-blue-500 bg-blue-500 bg-opacity-20 false svelte-1pnvkqi\">English </button><button class=\"px-4 py-2 block w-full text-left cursor-pointer lang-item false hover:text-red-500 hover:bg-red-500 hover:bg-opacity-20 hover:font-bold svelte-1pnvkqi\">Hindi </button><button class=\"px-4 py-2 block w-full text-left cursor-pointer lang-item false hover:text-red-500 hover:bg-red-500 hover:bg-opacity-20 hover:font-bold svelte-1pnvkqi\">Bengali </button></div></div> <button class=\"shrink-0\"><img class=\"border-2\" src=\"/image/warning.png\" alt=\"Report Question\" style=\"width: 30px;height: 30px;padding: 4px;border-radius: 50%\"></button></div></div>   <div class=\"question xl:text-lg px-4 py-2.5\"><p>Which statements are correct about degrees of freedom ?</p>\n<p>(A) A molecule with n degrees of freedom has n<mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"CHTML\" style=\"font-size: 119.5%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-msup><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-n\"></mjx-mi><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: 0.363em;\"><mjx-texatom size=\"s\" texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c32\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-texatom></mjx-script></mjx-msup></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi></mi><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> different ways of storing energy.</p>\n<p>(B) Each degree of freedom is associated with <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"CHTML\" style=\"font-size: 119.5%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mfrac><mjx-frac><mjx-num><mjx-nstrut></mjx-nstrut><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" size=\"s\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c31\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-num><mjx-dbox><mjx-dtable><mjx-line></mjx-line><mjx-row><mjx-den><mjx-dstrut></mjx-dstrut><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" size=\"s\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c32\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-den></mjx-row></mjx-dtable></mjx-dbox></mjx-frac></mjx-mfrac></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> RT average energy per mole.</p>\n<p>(C) A monatomic gas molecule has 1 rotational degree of freedom where as diatomic molecule has 2 rotational degrees of freedom.</p>\n<p>(D) <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"CHTML\" style=\"font-size: 119.5%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-msub><mjx-texatom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c43\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c48\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-texatom><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: -0.15em;\"><mjx-texatom size=\"s\" texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c34\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-texatom></mjx-script></mjx-msub></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi data-mjx-auto-op=\"false\">CH</mi></mrow><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mn>4</mn></mrow></msub></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> has a total of 6 degrees of freedom.</p>\n<p>Choose the correct answer from the options given below : </p></div></div> <div class=\"options md:px-4 flex flex-col gap-2 lg:gap-4\"><div role=\"button\" class=\"flex items-center gap-2 max-md:card md:rounded px-4 py-4 dark:border-gray-500 md:border-2 cursor-pointer select-none transition-all relative bg-opacity-20   hover:border-2   \"><div class=\"shrink-0 flex items-center justify-center text-white text-sm rounded-[50%] w-[25px] h-[25px] bg-blue-600  \">A</div>  <div class=\"grow question xl:text-lg\">(B) and (C) only</div> </div><div role=\"button\" class=\"flex items-center gap-2 max-md:card md:rounded px-4 py-4 dark:border-gray-500 md:border-2 cursor-pointer select-none transition-all relative bg-opacity-20   hover:border-2   \"><div class=\"shrink-0 flex items-center justify-center text-white text-sm rounded-[50%] w-[25px] h-[25px] bg-blue-600  \">B</div>  <div class=\"grow question xl:text-lg\">(B) and (D) only</div> </div><div role=\"button\" class=\"flex items-center gap-2 max-md:card md:rounded px-4 py-4 dark:border-gray-500 md:border-2 cursor-pointer select-none transition-all relative bg-opacity-20   hover:border-2   \"><div class=\"shrink-0 flex items-center justify-center text-white text-sm rounded-[50%] w-[25px] h-[25px] bg-blue-600  \">C</div>  <div class=\"grow question xl:text-lg\">(A) and (B) only</div> </div><div role=\"button\" class=\"flex items-center gap-2 max-md:card md:rounded px-4 py-4 dark:border-gray-500 md:border-2 cursor-pointer select-none transition-all relative bg-opacity-20   hover:border-2   \"><div class=\"shrink-0 flex items-center justify-center text-white text-sm rounded-[50%] w-[25px] h-[25px] bg-blue-600  \">D</div>  <div class=\"grow question xl:text-lg\">(C) and (D) only</div> </div></div>  <div class=\"text-center\"><button class=\"shadow drop-shadow-sm bg-blue-600 text-white px-4 py-2 rounded hover:font-bold transition-all select-none\" aria-label=\"Check Answer Button\">Check Answer</button></div> </div>",
