	        "explanation": "<div class=\"flex flex-col gap-2 max-md:card max-md:py-2\"> <div class=\"px-4\"><h2 class=\"my-2.5 text-lg text-blue-500 font-bold svelte-1pnvkqi\">Explanation</h2> <div class=\"question xl:text-lg mt-2\"><p><img src=\"https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/1500/image/1l6tcww86/734199e5-b8e2-4437-9e12-51b1caabbfd6/2566e370-1bd4-11ed-bd9f-71db3a4811b2/file-1l6tcww87.png?format=png\" data-orsrc=\"https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/image/1l6tcww86/734199e5-b8e2-4437-9e12-51b1caabbfd6/2566e370-1bd4-11ed-bd9f-71db3a4811b2/file-1l6tcww87.png\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; display: block; margin: 0px auto; max-height: 40vh;\" alt=\"JEE Main 2022 (Online) 25th July Morning Shift Physics - Heat and Thermodynamics Question 119 English Explanation\"></p>\n<p>Let AB is isothermal process and BC is adiabatic process then for AB process</p>\n<p>P<sub>A</sub>V<sub>A</sub> = P<sub>B</sub>V<sub>B</sub></p>\n<p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"CHTML\" style=\"font-size: 119.5%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c21D2\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo stretchy=\"false\">⇒</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> P<sub>B</sub> = 10<sup>7</sup> Nm<sup><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"CHTML\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2212\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>−</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container>2</sup></p>\n<p>For process BC</p>\n<p>P<sub>B</sub>V<mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"CHTML\" style=\"font-size: 119.5%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-msubsup><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-n\"></mjx-mi><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: -0.308em; margin-left: 0px;\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\" size=\"s\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D45F TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-spacer style=\"margin-top: 0.18em;\"></mjx-spacer><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\" size=\"s\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D435 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-script></mjx-msubsup></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msubsup><mi></mi><mi>B</mi><mi>r</mi></msubsup></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> = P<sub>C</sub> V<mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"CHTML\" style=\"font-size: 119.5%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-msubsup><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-n\"></mjx-mi><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: -0.323em; margin-left: 0px;\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\" size=\"s\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D45F TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-spacer style=\"margin-top: 0.18em;\"></mjx-spacer><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\" size=\"s\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D436 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-script></mjx-msubsup></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msubsup><mi></mi><mi>C</mi><mi>r</mi></msubsup></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></p>\n<p>P<sub>C</sub> = 3.536 x <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"CHTML\" style=\"font-size: 119.5%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-cD7\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>×</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> 10<sup>6</sup> Pa</p></div></div></div>",
