	        "explanation": "<div class=\"flex flex-col gap-2 max-md:card max-md:py-2\"> <div class=\"px-4\"><h2 class=\"my-2.5 text-lg text-blue-500 font-bold svelte-1pnvkqi\">Explanation</h2> <div class=\"question xl:text-lg mt-2\">For all process,\n<br><br>E<sub>AB</sub> = E<sub>AC</sub> = E<sub>AD</sub>\n<br><br>W<sub>AB</sub> &gt; 0 as volume increases.\n<br><br>W<sub>AC</sub> = 0 as volume constant.\n<br><br>W<sub>AD</sub> &lt; 0 as volume decreases.</div></div></div>",
