	        "explanation": "<div class=\"flex flex-col gap-2 max-md:card max-md:py-2\"> <div class=\"px-4\"><h2 class=\"my-2.5 text-lg text-blue-500 font-bold svelte-1pnvkqi\">Explanation</h2> <div class=\"question xl:text-lg mt-2\">For the process (c – a), <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"CHTML\" style=\"font-size: 119.5%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c394\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container>U<sub>ca</sub> = – 180 J<br><br>\nFor process (b – c) <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"CHTML\" style=\"font-size: 119.5%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2192\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo accent=\"false\" stretchy=\"false\">→</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> Isochoric (W<sub>bc</sub> = 0)<br><br>\n<mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"CHTML\" style=\"font-size: 119.5%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2234 TEX-A\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c394\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>∴</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container>U = 60 J<br><br>\nHeat absorbs along (a – b), Q<sub>ab</sub> = 250 J<br><br>\nAlso <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"CHTML\" style=\"font-size: 119.5%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2234 TEX-A\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c394\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>∴</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> U<sub>cycle</sub> = 0<br><br>\n<mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"CHTML\" style=\"font-size: 119.5%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2234 TEX-A\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c394\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>∴</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container>  U<sub>ab</sub> = 120 J<br><br>\nSo W<sub>a <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"CHTML\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2192\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo accent=\"false\" stretchy=\"false\">→</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> b</sub> = 130 J<br><br>\nTotal work done from (a <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"CHTML\" style=\"font-size: 119.5%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2192\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo accent=\"false\" stretchy=\"false\">→</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> b <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"CHTML\" style=\"font-size: 119.5%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2192\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo accent=\"false\" stretchy=\"false\">→</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> c)<br><br>\n= W<sub>ab</sub> + W<sub>bc</sub> = 130 J</div></div></div>",
