	        "explanation": "<div class=\"flex flex-col gap-2 max-md:card max-md:py-2\"> <div class=\"px-4\"><h2 class=\"my-2.5 text-lg text-blue-500 font-bold svelte-1pnvkqi\">Explanation</h2> <div class=\"question xl:text-lg mt-2\">We know,\n<br><br>PV = nRT\n<br><br>here R is a constant,\n<br><br>assuming n = number of moles does not change, we get, \n<br><br>PV = KT,  K = constant.\n<br><br>Given that, PV = constant,\n<br><br>So, T = constant, Hence the process is isothermol.\n<br><br>From the graph you  can see, \n<br><br>Pressure at  point 1 is higher than that at point 2. So correct answer is (c)</div></div></div>",
